cm_IIcQ3IcHCOoBKAs",null,null,null,[4],null,2,null,1]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["口味偏台式，價格低廉配料不算多，但平日可以無限加麵適合大胃王\n若回訪會選擇便宜的品項\n-\n起司可樂餅 🌕🌕🌕🌗🌑\n現炸十分燙口，起司味很濃\n但太貴了\n\n味噌鮮蔬 🌕🌕🌕🌕🌗\n味噌醬是精華，搭配著吃非常美味\n醬汁微辣，怕辣的要斟酌\n\n松露雞白湯拉麵 🌕🌕🌕🌖🌑\n菜單上標示有無溏心蛋很貼心，讓吃拉麵必點溏心蛋的人可以一目了然\n雞肉不濕潤，但也不會乾到無法下嚥\n麵條偏軟\n湯頭松露味滿重的，後段才會出現雞白湯味",null,[0,44]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/11089211807260762878/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUXRlSE4yVUZaM0VBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11089211807260762878/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUXRlSE4yVUZaM0VBRRAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/11089211807260762878/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUXRlSE4yVUZaM0VBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11089211807260762878/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUXRlSE4yVUZaM0VBRRAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/11089211807260762878/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUXRlSE4yVUZaM0VBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11089211807260762878/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVUXRlSE4yVUZaM0VBRRAA"]],[null,null,7461,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQteHN2UFZ3EAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x4a55c5322a6a0658!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgID-xsvPVw%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQteHN2UFZ3EAE\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQteHN2UFZ3Ei4KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJRC14c3ZQMXdFEhNDZ3dJOC1pU25BWVFpSUxUblFFGi0KFkNJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJRC14c3ZQTncSE0Nnd0k4LWlTbkFZUWlJTFRuUUUiEgkAAAAAAAAAABFYBmoqMsVVSioLMFlXQUduSWhCMzc\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwid58bMzNKWAxV4fPUHHcm_IIcQoykI6wEoDA"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwj4gdDMzNKWAxXSdF4EHfbPJv0Q0pMFCJABKAU"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwid58bMzNKWAxV4fPUHHc